# The file-making functions the capture worker BINARY may import (fix pass F-M3, review R63-08; decision D84 R-6).
# One name per line, without the leading underscore and without a $SUFFIX of the platform. `nm -u` of
# build/capture-worker is read after every link (Makefile): a watched function that is not listed here,
# and a listed one that is no longer imported, both stop the build. The watched set is FILE_MAKING of
# pinned_calls.py. A new line here is a decision, like a new row of pinned-calls.tsv.
fopen
ftruncate
link
open
rename
unlink
